      <div type="clause" n="4">
        <head>VI Atr (Latin Paraphrase) 4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Canonici namque in suis se monasteriis ita obseruent, ut in continentia pura et in castitate magna Domino regulariter deseruiant, horis competentibus officium diuinum in ecclesiis pariter concelebrent et, si eo loci substantie habundantia uictualis ne defuerit, in suis per dies singulos prandeant refectoriis, noctibus quoque singulis, ut eis regule monstrat auctoritas, in dormitoriis requiescant. Quodsi hec obseruare neglexerint, uel regulariter emendent uel de monasteriis eiciantur et Dei hereditate careant.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
